<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier, has been priced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson (books), Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.06     PAY DATE  S-09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    98.89     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND   *8 BP	SELL CONC *17 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p> NOTES   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	  *NEW SPLIT ON FEES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
